abstract: >-
  Six CSV files from one participant, Python code for descriptive analysis,
  and historical reviews of eleven devices and two facial analysis tools.
  Raw sensor readings and questionnaire responses cover Session 1. Supplied
  eye summaries cover three sessions. Device identity, calibration and
  cross-stream synchronization remain unverified. Code uses MIT. Original
  observations and authored documentation use CC BY 4.0 where the author
  holds rights. Questionnaire wording, answer options and product media
  retain third-party rights. Permission to redistribute instrument content
  openly is unestablished. See NOTICE.md and DATA_ETHICS.md. This metadata
  does not establish a deposited record or DOI.
